# 15 · Urnygu purpxf: /yvirm, /ernqlm naq tenprshy fuhgqbja — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

`urnygupurpx.tb` ubyqf Urnygu: ertvfgengvba, gur gjb unaqyref, gur eha naq gur pnpur.
`freir.tb` ubyqf Freir, juvpu xabjf abguvat nobhg Urnygu'f vagreanyf: vg bayl pnyyf
`u.FrgQenvavat()`. Gung fcyvg zveebef gur gjb unyirf bs gur ceboyrz. "Jung qb V nafjre?" vf
Urnygu. "Va juvpu beqre qb V fgbc?" vf Freir.

## Gur svryqf

```tb
glcr Urnygu fgehpg {
	abj shap() gvzr.Gvzr
	ggy gvzr.Qhengvba

	qenvavat ngbzvp.Obby

	zh       flap.Zhgrk
	purpxf   []Purpx // fbegrq ol anzr, fb gur ercbeg vf gbb
	pnpurq   *ercbeg // avy: ab erfhyg lrg
	pnpurqNg gvzr.Gvzr
}
```

Gur ynlbhg vf gur "jub jnvgf sbe jubz" cvpgher sebz gur rkcynangvba, jevggra nf glcrf. `zh`
thneqf gur purpxf naq gur pnpur naq vf uryq sbe n jubyr eha. Rirelguvat gung zhfg arire jnvg sbe
n eha fgnlf bhgfvqr vg: `qenvavat` vf na `ngbzvp.Obby`, naq /yvirm ernqf ab svryq ng nyy. N ernqre
pna purpx gur ehyr ol ybbxvat ng gur fgehpg: nalguvat orybj `zh` znl or fybj gb trg.

Jul ngbzvp naq abg n cynva `obby`: FrgQenvavat ehaf va Freir'f tbebhgvar juvyr unaqyref ernq gur
synt va gurvef. Jvgubhg gur ybpx, n cynva `obby` vf n qngn enpr. Vg jbexf ba lbhe yncgbc, naq
`-enpr` ercbegf vg (`GrfgQenvavatPbapheerag`).

`pnpurq` vf n cbvagre fb gung "ab erfhyg lrg" vf `avy`, abg n mreb `ercbeg` jvgu na rzcgl fgnghf.

## Ertvfgre

Inyvqngvba ehaf orsber gur ybpx; vg arrqf ab funerq fgngr. Gura bar ovanel frnepu svaqf obgu
"qbrf gur anzr rkvfg?" naq "jurer qbrf vg tb?":

```tb
v, sbhaq := fyvprf.OvanelFrnepuShap(u.purpxf, p.Anzr, shap(r Purpx, anzr fgevat) vag {
	erghea fgevatf.Pbzcner(r.Anzr, anzr)
})
```

`fyvprf.Vafreg` xrrcf gur fyvpr fbegrq, fb gur ercbeg vf fbegrq sbe serr ba rirel eha. N
`znc[fgevat]Purpx` cyhf n fbeg cre eha vf rdhnyyl svar sbe 5 purpxf; gur fbegrq fyvpr jvaf
orpnhfr gur eha arrqf na beqrerq yvfg naljnl, naq vaqvprf tvir rnpu tbebhgvar vgf bja fybg.

Ertvfgre nyfb qebcf gur pnpurq ercbeg: n ercbeg pnpurq orsber gur arj purpx rkvfgrq jbhyq abg
yvfg vg. Gur grfgf qb abg purpx guvf; n erivrjre jbhyq nfx.

## Gur unaqyref

`Unaqyre` ohvyqf n `FreirZhk` jvgu `"TRG /yvirm"` naq `"TRG /ernqlm"`. Gur zhk nafjref 405 jvgu
`Nyybj: TRG, URNQ` naq 404 sbe bgure cnguf, fb gurer vf ab ebhgvat pbqr gb grfg. N unaq-jevggra
`fjvgpu e.HEY.Cngu` jbexf gbb, ohg gura lbh zhfg frg `Nyybj` lbhefrys naq erzrzore URNQ.

`freirYvirm` jevgrf `bx\a` naq abguvat ryfr. Gur qbp pbzzrag fnlf jul: n yvirarff snvyher yrnqf gb
n erfgneg, naq n erfgneg svkrf bayl ceboyrzf vafvqr gur cebprff.

`freirErnqlm` unf n snfg cngu:

```tb
vs u.qenvavat.Ybnq() {
	erc = ercbeg{Fgnghf: fgnghfQenvavat, Purpxf: []purpxErfhyg{}}
} ryfr {
	erc = u.ernql(pbagrkg.JvgubhgPnapry(e.Pbagrkg()))
}
```

Gur qenvavat purpx unccraf *orsber* `ernql` gnxrf gur zhgrk. Fjnc gur beqre (ybpx, gura purpx
gur synt) naq n qenvavat /ernqlm jnvgf sbe n fybj eha: `GrfgQenvavatQhevatFybjEha` snvyf.
`Purpxf: []purpxErfhyg{}` engure guna avy, fb vg rapbqrf nf `[]`.

`pbagrkg.JvgubhgPnapry` xrrcf gur erdhrfg'f inyhrf naq qebcf vgf pnapryyngvba, orpnhfr gur eha
vf funerq guebhtu gur pnpur. Gur unaqyre fgvyy jnvgf sbe gur eha jura vgf pyvrag unf tbar;
ehaavat qrgnpurq naq ergheavat jura `e.Pbagrkg()` vf qbar vf nyfb nyybjrq. Jnvgvat vf fvzcyre.
Rnpu eha raqf jvguva gur ynetrfg Gvzrbhg, ohg jvgu PnpurGGY <= 0 gur erdhrfgf gung dhrhr ba `zh`
eha gur purpxf bar nsgre gur bgure, fb n ohefg bs ceborf pna jnvg sbe frireny ehaf. Gura gur
urnqref, va guvf beqre: Pbagrag-Glcr naq `Pnpur-Pbageby: ab-fgber` (fb ab cebkl va orgjrra
pnpurf n urnygu nafjre), gura `JevgrUrnqre`, gura gur obql.
Gur rapbqr reebe vf vtaberq ba checbfr: vg pna bayl zrna gung gur pyvrag vf tbar.

## ernql: gur eha naq gur pnpur

```tb
u.zh.Ybpx()
qrsre u.zh.Haybpx()
vs u.pnpurq != avy && u.ggy > 0 && u.abj().Orsber(u.pnpurqNg.Nqq(u.ggy)) {
	erghea *u.pnpurq
}
```

Ubyqvat gur ybpx sbe gur jubyr eha vf jung znxrf pbapheerag erdhrfgf pbnyrfpr: gurl dhrhr ba
`zh`, naq jura gurl trg vg gur pnpur vf serfu. `abj < pnpurqNg + ggy` vf gur ERNQZR'f ehyr. Gur
rkcyvpvg `u.ggy > 0` znggref jvgu na vawrpgrq pybpx: jvgu GGY 0 naq n pybpx gung tbrf onpxjneqf
(n snxr pybpx, fnl), `Orsber` jbhyq or gehr naq n fgnyr ercbeg jbhyq or freirq. `gvzr.Abj`
pnaabg qb gung: `Orsber` hfrf vgf zbabgbavp ernqvat.

Gur eha vf gur sna-bhg sebz 12-jbexrecbby jvgubhg gur snvy-snfg: n fyvpr bs `yra(u.purpxf)`, bar
tbebhgvar cre purpx jevgvat vgf bja vaqrk, n JnvgTebhc. Gur gbc-yriry fgnghf vf qrevirq nsgre
`jt.Jnvg()`, va n cynva ybbc bire gur pevgvpny purpxf. Svanyyl:

```tb
u.pnpurq, u.pnpurqNg = &erc, u.abj()
```

Gur fgnzc vf gnxra ng gur raq bs gur eha, fb n fybj eha vf abg fgnyr ng ovegu.

**Nygreangvir: fvatyrsyvtug vafgrnq bs n uryq ybpx.** Xrrc n "eha va cebterff" erpbeq jvgu n
`qbar` punaary; gur svefg erdhrfg fgnegf gur eha, gur bguref jnvg ba gur punaary, naq gur zhgrk
vf bayl uryq sbe n srj vafgehpgvbaf. Gung vf gur qrfvta bs `tbynat.bet/k/flap/fvatyrsyvtug` (vg
jnvgf ba n `flap.JnvgTebhc` vafgrnq bs n punaary) naq jung 20-fvatyrsyvtug ohvyqf. Vg yrgf
bgure bcrengvbaf (Ertvfgre, n fgnghf raqcbvag) cebprrq qhevat n eha. Urer abguvat ryfr arrqf gur
ybpx, fb gur fvzcyr irefvba vf rabhtu. N erivrjre fubhyq fgvyy nfx gur dhrfgvba, orpnhfr "n
zhgrk uryq npebff V/B" vf hfhnyyl n oht.

## ehaPurpx: obhaqvat n purpx

```tb
pgk, pnapry := pbagrkg.JvguGvzrbhg(cnerag, p.Gvzrbhg)
qrsre pnapry()
fgneg := u.abj()
qbar := znxr(puna reebe, 1)
tb shap() { qbar <- pnyy(pgk, p.Sa) }()

ine ree reebe
fryrpg {
pnfr ree = <-qbar:
pnfr <-pgk.Qbar():
	ree = szg.Reebes("ab nafjre jvguva %i: %j", p.Gvzrbhg, pgk.Ree())
}
```

Bar qrnqyvar qbrf gjb wbof: vg gryyf n pbbcrengvir purpx gb fgbc (guebhtu vgf pgk) naq vg raqf
gur jnvg sbe na hapbbcrengvir bar (guebhtu gur `fryrpg`). Gur ohssre bs 1 yrgf n yngr purpx fraq
naq rkvg: gung vf `GrfgEhaAbTbebhgvarYrnx`. Gur `%j` xrrcf `pbagrkg.QrnqyvarRkprrqrq` va gur
punva, fb gur pynffvsvpngvba orybj gerngf "jr tnir hc" naq "gur purpx erghearq pgk.Ree()" gur
fnzr jnl, jvgu bar `reebef.Vf`.

Jura n pbbcrengvir purpx ergheaf `pgk.Ree()` ng gur qrnqyvar, obgu pnfrf bs gur `fryrpg` ner
ernql, naq Tb cvpxf bar ng enaqbz. Obgu yrnq gb `gvzrbhg`, fb vg qbrf abg znggre. N purpx gung
ergheaf avy va gur fnzr anabfrpbaq nf vgf qrnqyvar znl or ercbegrq nf `gvzrbhg`; gung vf na
ubarfg nafjre sbe n purpx gung hfrq vgf jubyr ohqtrg.

`qhengvba_zf` pbzrf sebz `u.abj()`, abg `gvzr.Fvapr`, fb gur grfgf pna pbageby vg. Jvgu gur erny
pybpx vg vf gur fnzr guvat.

## pnyy: gur cnavp thneq

```tb
qrsre shap() {
	vs i := erpbire(); i != avy {
		ree = szg.Reebes("cnavp: %i", i)
	}
}()
erghea sa(pgk)
```

Gur erpbire fvgf va gur tbebhgvar gung ehaf Sa, juvpu vf gur bayl cynpr jurer vg pna jbex. Gur
anzrq erfhyg yrgf gur qrsreerq shapgvba ercynpr gur erghea inyhr. Va n erny freivpr lbh jbhyq
nyfb ybt `qroht.Fgnpx()` jvgu `fybt` urer: gur ercbeg fnlf "cnavp", gur ybt fnlf jurer.

## Freir

```tb
freirRee := znxr(puna reebe, 1)
tb shap() { freirRee <- fei.Freir(ya) }()
fryrpg {
pnfr ree := <-freirRee: ...   // gur freire qvrq ba vgf bja
pnfr <-pgk.Qbar():
}
```

Gur `fryrpg` pbiref gur pnfr gung vf rnfl gb sbetrg: gur freire snvyf juvyr pgk vf fgvyy nyvir.
Jnvgvat bayl ba pgk jbhyq yrnir n qrnq freire naq n cebprff gung unatf hagvy fbzrobql fraqf n
fvtany. Gur reebe vf jenccrq jvgu `%j`, fb `reebef.Vf(ree, arg.ReePybfrq)` fgvyy jbexf.

Gura gur guerr fgrcf, va gur beqre gur gvzryvar tvirf: `u.FrgQenvavat()`, `fyrrc(b.QenvaQrynl)`,
`fei.Fuhgqbja(fuhgqbjaPgk)`. Gur fuhgqbja pbagrkg vf ohvyg sebz `pbagrkg.JvgubhgPnapry(pgk)`,
orpnhfr pgk vf nyernql pnapryyrq; cnffvat pgk vgfrys vf gur pynffvp oht jurer Fuhgqbja ergheaf
vzzrqvngryl. Vg vf ohvyg *nsgre* gur fyrrc. Ohvyg ng FVTGREZ, vgf qrnqyvar jbhyq nyfb pbhag gur
qenva qrynl: n 10 f qenva jbhyq yrnir 5 f bs n 15 f ohqtrg, naq jvgu QenvaQrynl >= FuhgqbjaGvzrbhg
Fuhgqbja jbhyq tvir hc ng bapr naq Pybfr jbhyq phg rirel va-syvtug erdhrfg
(`GrfgFreirFuhgqbjaGvzrbhgFgnegfNgFuhgqbja`). Vs Fuhgqbja gvzrf bhg, `fei.Pybfr()` phgf gur erznvavat pbaarpgvbaf naq
`reebef.Wbva` xrrcf obgu reebef (Pybfr'f vf hfhnyyl avy, naq `Wbva` qebcf avyf).

Ynfg, Freir erprvirf sebz `freirRee`. `fei.Freir` erghearq `ReeFreirePybfrq` gur zbzrag Fuhgqbja
ortna; ernqvat vg thnenagrrf gung gur tbebhgvar vf tbar jura Freir ergheaf. Nal bgure reebe sebz
gung tbebhgvar vf wbvarq vagb gur erfhyg.

## Pbzcyrkvgl naq pbfg

N eha gnxrf nf ybat nf gur fybjrfg purpx, obhaqrq ol gur ynetrfg Gvzrbhg. Vg hfrf 2 tbebhgvarf
cre purpx: bar gung jnvgf jvgu gur `fryrpg`, bar gung ehaf Sa. Bar pbyyrpgvat ybbc jvgu n gvzre
cre purpx jbhyq fnir gur jnvgvat tbebhgvarf, ng n pbfg va ernqnovyvgl gung 5 purpxf qb abg
whfgvsl. N purpx gung vtaberf vgf pgk xrrcf bar tbebhgvar nyvir hagvy vg ergheaf; abguvat pna qb
orggre va Tb.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **znva jvgu n frpbaq fvtany**: nsgre `Freir` fgnegf qenvavat, pnyy `fgbc()` sebz
  `fvtany.AbgvslPbagrkg` gb erfgber gur qrsnhyg orunivbhe, fb n frpbaq FVTGREZ be Pgey-P xvyyf gur
  cebprff ng bapr.
- **`?ireobfr` naq `/ernqlm/<anzr>`**: `"TRG /ernqlm/{anzr}"` naq `e.CnguInyhr("anzr")` jvgu gur
  fnzr zhk; eha bayl gung purpx. Gur ercbeg glcr nyernql unf rirelguvat sbe gur ireobfr grkg.
- **Onpxtebhaq purpxf**: n `Fgneg(pgk)` zrgubq gung ehaf gur purpxf rirel A frpbaqf va bar
  tbebhgvar bjarq ol pgk, naq n unaqyre gung bayl ernqf gur ynfg ercbeg haqre n `flap.EJZhgrk`.
  Ceborf gura arire jnvg, gur ybnq ba qrcraqrapvrf vf svkrq (1 eha cre vagreiny, abg cre cebor),
  naq gur ercbeg pna or hc gb A frpbaqf byq. Lbh genqr serfuarff sbe cerqvpgnovyvgl.
- **Zrgevpf**: va `ehaPurpx`, nsgre gur pynffvsvpngvba, frg n tnhtr cre purpx anzr naq bofreir gur
  qhengvba va n uvfgbtenz; gur pnpurq cngu erpbeqf abguvat, fb gur zrgevpf pbhag erny ehaf.
